        "original_id": "dbb266c1-398b-575b-8521-66247e303645",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rudolf Schwarzkogler, Howard B. Zieff, Günter Brus, Otto Mühl, Hermann Nitsch\n- Organizations: Viennese Actionism\n- Roles: performance artist, director, television commercial director, advertising photographer\n- Places: Vienna\n\nFacts:\n- Rudolf Schwarzkogler was born on 13 November 1940 in Vienna and died on 20 June 1969 in Vienna.\n- Howard B. Zieff was born on 21 October 1927 and died on 22 February 2009.\n- Rudolf Schwarzkogler was an Austrian performance artist closely associated with the Viennese Actionism group.\n- The Viennese Actionism group included artists Günter Brus, Otto Mühl, and Hermann Nitsch.\n- Howard B. Zieff, pronounced \"Zeef,\" was an American director, television commercial director, and advertising photographer.",
